<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 27.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 27.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p>1    Kalamazoo Hlds	20.26     2.27</p>
<p>2    Central Norseman    14.21     0.95</p>
<p>3    Telecasters Nqld    13.73     5.10</p>
<p>4    Pac Mutal Aust	12.71     2.36</p>
<p>5    Kurts (P) Prop	10.79     1.39</p>
<p>6    Prime Credit Tr     10.65     0.92</p>
<p>7    Prop Income Inv     10.42     0.98</p>
<p>8    Indu Property	 10.34     0.88</p>
<p>9    Multistack	    10.17     0.30</p>
<p>10   BT Prop Trust	 10.07     1.62</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual	9.98     1.06</p>
<p>12   Gem Property Tr	9.73     1.44</p>
<p>13   Villa World	    9.52     1.05</p>
